## Bagian A. Verifikasi 8 Tambalan di Blok Security Rules (§12)

| ID Temuan | Status | Bukti & Verifikasi di [PRD LMS Interaktif v0.7.md](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L211-L335) |
| --- | :---: | --- |
| **K-BARU-09** | **BENAR** | Nol aritmetika `Timestamp * 60` atau `Timestamp + int`. Seluruh operasi waktu di Rules memakai `duration.value(q(request.resource.data.quizId).toleransiMulai, 'm')` ([baris 238](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L238)), `duration.value(st(attemptId).duration, 'm') + duration.value(90, 's')` ([baris 270, 276](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L270-L276)), dan `duration.value(30, 'd')` ([baris 236, 268](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L236)). |
| **K-BARU-10** | **BENAR** | Pada `match /attempts/{attemptId}`, `allow update` ([baris 271–276](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L271-L276)) membaca `closeAt`, `startedAt`, dan `duration` melalui fungsi `st(attemptId)` (`get(/databases/$(database)/documents/starts/$(sid)).data` di [baris 221](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L221)), bukan lagi dari `resource.data`. Retry `setDoc(..., {merge: true})` kini idempoten dan valid. |
| **K-BARU-11** | **BENAR** | Fungsi `isAdmin()` memiliki guard `request.auth != null` ([baris 215–218](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L215-L218)); akses baca admin (`|| isAdmin()`) telah dipasang pada `allow read` di `starts` ([baris 225](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L225)), `quizzes` ([baris 245](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L245)), `attempts` ([baris 261](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L261)), `results` ([baris 282](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L282)), `users` ([baris 295](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L295)), dan `progress` ([baris 305](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L305)). |
| **K-BARU-12** | **BENAR** | Blok `match /progress/{uid}` ([baris 304–307](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L304-L307)) dan `match /admins/{uid}` ([baris 310–313](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L310-L313)) sudah ditambahkan dengan hak akses yang tepat. |
| **K-BARU-13** | **BENAR** | Metadata jadwal ringkas (`quizId`, `openAt`, `toleransiMulai`, `duration`, `closeAt`, `version`) disimpan di `classes/{code}.quizzes` ([§10 baris 157](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L157), [§11 baris 185](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L185)) yang dapat dibaca siswa login (`match /classes/{code}` `allow read: if request.auth != null;` di [baris 316–318](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L316-L318)), sehingga siswa dapat menyusun dokumen `starts` tanpa membaca `quizzes` terlebih dahulu. |
| **S-BARU-08** | **BENAR** | Pada `match /users/{uid}`, `allow update` ([baris 298–300](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L298-L300)) membatasi siswa hanya pada `affectedKeys().hasOnly(['nama','updatedAt'])`, sedangkan perubahan `kelas` hanya bisa dilakukan oleh `isAdmin()`. Karena `allow delete` tidak dibuka (default `false`), siswa juga tidak bisa menghapus lalu membuat ulang dokumen `users/{uid}` untuk mengganti kelas. |
| **S-BARU-09** | **BENAR** | Validasi TTL 30 hari ditegakkan di server pada `starts` (`request.resource.data.expireAt == request.resource.data.closeAt + duration.value(30, 'd')` di [baris 236](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L236)) dan `attempts` (`request.resource.data.expireAt == st(attemptId).closeAt + duration.value(30, 'd')` di [baris 268](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L268)), serta dikunci dari perubahan saat `update` ([baris 273](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L273)). |
| **K-BARU-03** | **BENAR** *(di Rules §12)* | Pada `match /results/{resultId}` ([baris 281–285](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L281-L285)), aturan sudah diubah menjadi `allow create, update: if isAdmin();` dan `allow read: if request.auth != null && (request.auth.uid == resource.data.uid || isAdmin());` (revisi in-place tanpa dokumen `_v2`, ditegaskan di [baris 13, 335, 499](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L335)). *(Catatan kosmetik: sisa teks lama `create-only / _v2` masih tertinggal di narasi baris 129, 157, 191, 355, 480, 493 — lihat Bagian B).* |

