## Bagian C. Hitung Ulang Aritmetika Kuota (§13.1)

### 1. Verifikasi Baris demi Baris (1.000 Akun Siswa, 6 Mapel × 300 = 1.800 Sesi Ujian/Hari)

| # | Komponen ([§13.1 Baris 392–410](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.7.md#L392-L410)) | Klaim Read v0.7 | Hitung Ulang Read Auditor | Klaim Write v0.7 | Hitung Ulang Write Auditor | Verifikasi Operasi & Hidden Rule-Get |
| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
| 1 | Create `starts` (rule-get `quizzes` + `users`) | 3.600 | **3.600** | 1.800 | **1.800** | **Tepat.** 6× `q(quizId)` di-cache = 1 read + 1 `get(users)` = 2 rule-get × 1.800 sesi = 3.600 read; 1.800 write. |
| 2 | Muat soal `quizzes` (doc + rule `exists(starts)`) | 3.600 | **3.600** *(atau **5.400** jika `isAdmin()` di kiri)* | 0 | **0** | 1.800 doc read + 1.800 `exists(starts)`. *(Jika urutan `isAdmin() \|\| ...` di baris 245 tidak dibalik, tambah +1.800 `exists(admins)` = 5.400).* |
| 3 | Create `attempts` (rule-get `starts`) | 1.800 | **1.800** | 1.800 | **1.800** | **Tepat.** 4× `st(attemptId)` di-cache = 1 rule-get × 1.800 = 1.800 read; 1.800 write. |
| 3b | Margin retry/update `attempts` 10% | 180 | **180** | 180 | **180** | **Tepat.** 180 update × (1 write + 1 rule-get `st(attemptId)` di-cache). |
| 4 | Grading (`attempts` + `quizKeys` + rule-get `admins`) | 1.824 | **1.824** | 1.800 | **1.800** | **Tepat.** Baca `attempts` (1.800) + `quizKeys` (6) + 6 mapel × 3 evaluasi `isAdmin()` (18) = 1.824 read; 1.800 write `results`. |
| 5 | Baca `results` siswa + tulis `leaderboard` (+ `admins`) | 1.806 | **1.806** | 6 | **6** | **Tepat.** Baca `results` (1.800; `uid == resource.data.uid` men-*short-circuit* `isAdmin()`) + 6 rule-get `admins` saat tulis 6 `leaderboard`. |
| 6 | Baca `leaderboard` siswa | 1.800 | **1.800** | 0 | **0** | **Tepat.** 1.800 doc read, 0 rule-get (`request.auth != null`). |
| 7 | Baca/tulis `progress` (modul + XP) | 1.800 | **1.800** | 2.000–3.000 | **2.000–3.000** | **Tepat.** 1.800 read (`uid == uid` men-*short-circuit* `isAdmin()`); 1.000 write modul + 1.000–2.000 write XP. |
| 8 | Login `users/{uid}` (+ `classes/{code}` jadwal) | 1.800 *(s.d. 3.600)* | **1.800** *(s.d. **3.600**)* | 0 | **0** | **Tepat.** 1.800 read `users` (0 rule-get); `classes/{code}` di-cache di `dbApp` (atau +1.800 read jika *cache miss*). |
| 9 | Pembahasan `quizExplanations` (opsional) | 0–1.800 | **0–1.800** | 0 | **0** | **Tepat.** Gerbang `request.time > resource.data.closeAt` = 0 rule-get. |
| 10 | Browsing kursus/modul/latihan (bundle statis) | 0 | **0** | 0 | **0** | **Tepat.** Disajikan dari JSON statis GitHub Pages (`public/data/`). |
| — | **TOTAL HARI UJIAN** | **18.210–20.010** *(worst **21.810**)* | **18.210–20.010** *(atau **20.010–23.610**)* | **7.586–8.586** | **7.586–8.586** | **Read: 36,4%–40,0% (worst 43,6% / 47,2%). Write: 37,9%–42,9%.** |
| — | **TOTAL EKSTREM** (+Onboarding 1.000 & Sertifikat 1.800) | **22.010–25.610** | **22.010–25.610** *(atau **23.810–27.410**)* | **12.386** | **11.386–12.386** | **Read: 44,0%–51,2% (s.d. 54,8%). Write: 56,9%–61,9%.** |

### 2. Verdict Kelulusan Kuota Paket Spark
- **Read Harian (≤ 50.000/hari):** **18.210–20.010** (36,4%–40,0%), *worst-case* **21.810–23.610** (43,6%–47,2%), ekstrem **22.010–27.410** (44,0%–54,8%) → **LULUS (Headroom > 22.500 read/hari).**
- **Write Harian (≤ 20.000/hari):** **7.586–8.586** (37,9%–42,9%), ekstrem **12.386** (61,9%) → **LULUS (Headroom > 7.600 write/hari).**
- **Delete Harian (≤ 20.000/hari):** TTL 30 hari `starts` (1.800) + `attempts` (1.800) = **3.600 delete/hari** (18,0%) → **LULUS.**
- **Storage (≤ 1 GiB) & Egress (≤ 10 GiB/bulan):** ~200–350 MB storage aktif & ~2,7–3,1 GiB/bulan egress → **LULUS.**

---

## Vonis Akhir

**SIAP IMPLEMENTASI** — Seluruh 8 temuan kritis dan sedang dari audit ronda-2 telah ditambal dengan benar di blok Security Rules §12 tanpa menyisakan bug pemblokir, dan anggaran kuota harian maupun ekstrem lulus dengan margin aman di bawah batas keras Firebase Spark (Read 36,4%–43,6%, Write 37,9%–42,9%, Ekstrem Write 61,9%).
